{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Song of Slavs you have to try on the role of a young Tsar who must establish his settlement and withstand hordes of treacherous enemies. You will have to demonstrate your leadership skills throughout the day and under different weather conditions. Increase the population of your village, assign jobs and turn your village into a glorious city of the ancient Slavs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tsar's Retinue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warrior in your retinue can become unique with the help of a combat system tied to the squad and builds of each individual unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/af1972d059b98221545c0887bd251fdd.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/af1972d059b98221545c0887bd251fdd.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn to the powers of the ancient pagan gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep faith in your gods! Mighty oak trees are suitable not just as a resource, but also for creating powerful idols that will help protect your settlement. Choose which idol to sacrifice to. You can sacrifice your settler for the sake of peace and prosperity, or you can sacrifice food for the sake of new knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3acc73c30501aa3ea867e89115b818b0.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3acc73c30501aa3ea867e89115b818b0.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop yourself and your people:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having sufficiently developed your settlement, you will unlock horses and be able to saddle a steed, and your peasants will have access to a cart for transporting more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/9b8162c6c66c0474755277d1a658bf28.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/9b8162c6c66c0474755277d1a658bf28.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen and develop your settlement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and upgrade various buildings to suit the needs of your settlement - a house, a farm, a barn, a bathhouse, and even several idols. Each type of building requires certain resources, but provides different development bonuses. Need new units or resources? Place new buildings in your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3bfd1497617bdcdfc295881635f19074.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3bfd1497617bdcdfc295881635f19074.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set your priorities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose what and where to build. You can strengthen your defenses or expand your army by wisely managing the settlement's resources. Each building has its own purpose and will help you implement your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/5afe72e8acdd66b07674c9db969a9551.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/5afe72e8acdd66b07674c9db969a9551.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handcrafted pixel art and music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in Slavic culture with magnificent music, sound effects, and incredible pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/dc942fa8ef354f5f0941f0220d5a8f79.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=230 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646690?t=1769416692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646690?t=1769416692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/3b58072a5fd6f4efb6fec659654643eb7f37c432/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769416692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/3b58072a5fd6f4efb6fec659654643eb7f37c432/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769416692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3019890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Song of Slavs you have to try on the role of a young Tsar who must establish his settlement and withstand hordes of treacherous enemies. You will have to demonstrate your leadership skills throughout the day and under different weather conditions. Increase the population of your village, assign jobs and turn your village into a glorious city of the ancient Slavs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Tsar's Retinue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warrior in your retinue can become unique with the help of a combat system tied to the squad and builds of each individual unit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/af1972d059b98221545c0887bd251fdd.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/af1972d059b98221545c0887bd251fdd.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn to the powers of the ancient pagan gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep faith in your gods! Mighty oak trees are suitable not just as a resource, but also for creating powerful idols that will help protect your settlement. Choose which idol to sacrifice to. You can sacrifice your settler for the sake of peace and prosperity, or you can sacrifice food for the sake of new knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3acc73c30501aa3ea867e89115b818b0.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3acc73c30501aa3ea867e89115b818b0.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop yourself and your people:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having sufficiently developed your settlement, you will unlock horses and be able to saddle a steed, and your peasants will have access to a cart for transporting more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/9b8162c6c66c0474755277d1a658bf28.poster.avif?t=1769416692\" width=618 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/9b8162c6c66c0474755277d1a658bf28.webm?t=1769416692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strengthen and develop your settlement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and upgrade various buildings to suit the needs of your settlement - a house, a farm, a barn, a bathhouse, and even several idols. Each type of building requires certain resources, but provides different development bonuses. Need new units or resources? Place new buildings in your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646690/extras/3bfd1497617bdcdfc